# plinth · a square stand with softened edges, to show something on
# plinth(at, height, material) stands it on the floor at `at` and gives it
# back; what it shows goes at at + vec(0, height, 0).
#
# kind: piece
# place: plinth(AT)
# credit: J Production, made in Loop3D
# licence: our own work, free for every J Production project
# from: the Showcase (2026-11-06)
# tags: stand, stone, display
# size: hand
# sockets: top

to plinth(at, height: 1.0, material: "marble")
  return box(size: vec(0.6, height, 0.6), at: at + vec(0, height / 2, 0), material: material, round: 0.02)
